    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17566" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐταυτόθεν</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of oneself,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Euryph.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.6.19
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐταυτοῦ</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐταρχ-τῶ</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐταυτῆς</span></b>  (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τᾶς</span>), 
				Dor.
			 for 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτοῦ, ἑαυτῆς, πεπαίδευται γὰρ
					αὐταυτᾶς ὕπο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epich.
					172.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.646
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Heraclea</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Archyt.
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
