				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Axiop.
				1.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diotog.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.7.62
			</span></i>: acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐταυτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
