				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.7.64
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐταυτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					4.156
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Aegina</span>): as Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς</span></div>
